Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Animate 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得以前放学的时候偶尔去那里买漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.27,0:02:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来很有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:02:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久违的第一份打工啊|
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:01.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,体力劳动族！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我斗志燃烧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不算真正的打工了 而是以偶像的身份去的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在听吗？听得到我说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  驱先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ani mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿咧？始你没听过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一家充满着爱与梦想还有萌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个蓝色的招牌那家店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萌？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兴奋起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了机器人漫书什么的最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春明天要早起不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:03:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是该马上睡觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:04:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  始你也会为我倒红茶  很少见啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安排明天的日程表每个人分配该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有擅长和不擅长的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我一开始思考谁最适合哪项工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能把这些工作留给月城先生吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我喜欢做这些准备工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我自己想做的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.99,0:04:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些天你就一直在忙这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有别的事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过稍微保密一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎各位今天来到Animate池袋本店
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教 Six Gravity的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本次一日店长活动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们选择弥生春先生当店长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他Six Gravity成员作为员工
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分散在各层帮忙解决不同的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.04,0:05:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弥生先生你说的东西已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  大家注意了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.47,0:05:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次活动  我不是只当个一日店长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也计划了一些我们可以做到的有趣的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是  被采纳的点子就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月兔？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.53,0:05:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是普通的月兔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭中粗黑_GBK}啊 它穿着Animate{\fs98\fn汉仪玄宋 85S}®{\fs64\fn方正兰亭中粗黑_GBK}员工制服啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？不止如此吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为一日店长活动的纪念
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得有一个这样的月兔很不错  是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了！眼镜兔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是以春前辈为原型的版本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦 做的真的不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.93,0:06:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连泪痣都有了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前一直想知道你在偷偷忙什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  之前不确定这些月兔能不能按时送到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:31.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以确定送到之前我不会说这些
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛  我理解这情况
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过本次活动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:43.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果弥生先生的月兔计划能成功
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们不仅有一日店长活动 还可以举办一个新歌的首发会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提案
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把月兔…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼镜兔？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天在这里卖出一千份的话 就达成目标了 ！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千份？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,—千份？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千份？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.35,0:07:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个很不错的整数吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话 也可以是10个或者100个呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要太担心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只要卖掉一千份就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是要用微笑面对挑战啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.28,0:07:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么卖掉一千份啊  春前辈有具体想法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚正要去征求大家的想法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把最关键的地方留给我们解决啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海报都做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是一个红色边框的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说明这是Animate发售呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:46.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋也太了解关于Animate的事了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经常来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上只要有时间我就会经常来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是得卖一千份什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相当多的数量了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能做的就是靠下功夫和努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,期待着大家的好点子了请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么今天一天加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咻咻咻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.35,0:08:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思我要过去请把路让开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 比平时的舞蹈要难上好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 请大大地深呼吸一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么为什么为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁也不愿意靠过来啊  真的这样就可以了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题  始君即使只是站着客人们都好像已经非常开心了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  又吐槽我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,页是的  又吐槽我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同样是工作  这区别
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.11,0:09:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋  这大概就是因才适用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微打扰一下可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.87,0:09:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 请问有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 被外地的孙子拜托了  让我来找一张CD
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 能把标题告诉我是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起哦 写下标题的纸条丢在家里了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊  关于这张CD你还记得其他的信息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯这张光盘里只有声优出演  是个子很高的男性
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常有人气  好像是他出演的一部动漫作品的CD
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是什么  会唱一种特别角色的角色歌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.55,0:10:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 猜不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不介意的话 我来帮你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人 请往这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿啦 谢谢你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎么说信息也太少了 找起来应该很费时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊对啦 就是这个鱼糕之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:46.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能找到真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好快 话说鱼糕。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仪式已经办过 好像是8集结束时播放过的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有翼合唱的歌  你知道在哪里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个的话在这里哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.29,0:11:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问那个限定版还有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去确认一下库存哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.55,0:11:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  女儿叫我来取这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是已经预约过的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个  标题已经
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.81,0:11:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来用收款机确认一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个有初回特典  请带回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢您了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  做的真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:43.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不错呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:12:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 限定月兔在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.19,0:12:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fn方正粗圆_GBK\fs190\c&H7E3A4E&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HD7D7D7&}{\move(680,1300,680,850)}躁动 • • •
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fn方正粗圆_GBK\fs120\c&H7E3A4E&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HD7D7D7&}{\move(1400,1300,1400,650)}躁动 • • •
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fn方正粗圆_GBK\fs120\c&H7E3A4E&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HD7D7D7&}{\move(240,1300,240,650)}躁动 • • •
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个模型真的超可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比想象中难好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 不是只有开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,商品台很多 记笔记太有用了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的海报也相当不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是在压膜可是大失败
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.85,0:13:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  葵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了可别吃惊 经过我的反复练习 现在已经是专业压膜师了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来不是这样正式的帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为春君的提案才这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春君这样说过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.21,0:13:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们自己能在舞台上唱歌 是因为有各种各样的人在支持着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会场  音响还有其他工作人员
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.76,0:14:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们的存在才能让更多人听到我们的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个大家都经历过  所以应该都能明白
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.15,0:14:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜的是  舞台上的歌声不能传达到每个粉丝身边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能来会场  需要代替不在场的人把歌声传达给对方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中有一个媒介就是CD
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,CD排列在全国各地的各种各样的商店里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果上来说  比演唱会现场更能让更多的人听到歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己活动的背后 除了在会场亲身感受到的工作人员和相关人员以外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还感受到有像这种店的工作人员也在默默的支持着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:15:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会比之前更加珍惜的唱起歌来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春君这样说过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我明白了 交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我如月恋会把CD里包含着的爱和歌声传达给粉丝们的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋君真是热血啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.31,0:15:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新君也偶尔热血一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都很燃的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的时间也加油吧  葵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 加油吧  驱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下去 开始摆放的是今天开始的出售的杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就按大家说的melon摆法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,melon摆法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.35,0:16:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为一开始是melonbooks关始摆放的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以大家就都叫它melon摆法了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像这种感觉摆成一座塔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月免快没有多少了 大家都到一层限定卖场集合
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:53.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.65,0:16:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做到了呢 卖掉了一千个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 真是的 目标达成
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 一日店长
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 始
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢今天来的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Six Gravity的睦月始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Grwi的弥生春
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为今天的一日店长
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然是临时决定的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.18,0:18:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但依然购买了限定月兔的客人们谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冋时  很真心地谢谢所有客人包容我们不成熟的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs46\pos(1192.667,990)}粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一直支持我们的Fan们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直在较远的舞台上接受大家的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天在冋一个地方站着  和大家面对面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想今后如果有更多这样见面的的机会就太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.09,0:18:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说  还有一些意料之外的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓了一跳呢是吧 始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.68,0:18:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还行吧 但确实很担心就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春月兔的目标数也达到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.81,0:19:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春月兔君的眼镜很可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实 本人就很有味道嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真喜欢这个玩笑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.07,0:19:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,始的工作也真是干得不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始这个工作后 就使用过各种各样的造型
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来 就是已经习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然还想再多聊一些  但差不多没有时间了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 接下来就请我们的队长来说两句结束语吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束语吗 我也和春一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为能和大家近距离接触
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以感受到了比平时更强烈的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这热情不断鼓励着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.86,0:19:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因为有这些我们才能够继续努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.99,0:19:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真的非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今后也请大家多多关照Six Gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.87,0:19:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 接下来马上要开始大家期待已久的新曲活动了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Six Gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
