Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是卯月新
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.02,0:23:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和葵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.27,0:23:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳和夜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上要开始第一次的舞台剧了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.65,0:23:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我有很努力地练习
